  <ul>
    <li>A <strong>takedown recurve</strong> is the classic camping bow: it breaks into three pieces, packs small and has almost nothing to adjust or break.</li>
    <li>For target fun at camp, a <strong>light draw weight</strong> is more enjoyable and safer. Small-game hunting needs more, and local laws set the rules.</li>
